    "## 1. Environment Setup & Configuration\n",
    "\n",
    "**DatasetHA v2 - Proper Evaluation Metrics & Baselines**\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook:\n",
    "- Loads DatasetHA (.npy files): X_train, X_val, X_test with y_val, y_test\n",
    "- Trains GRU and Transformer models on benign-only training data\n",
    "- Evaluates using **PR-AUC, Precision, Recall** (not accuracy)\n",
    "- Reports **max and p95 aggregation** for error windows\n",
    "- Includes threshold baseline and Isolation Forest baseline"
   ]
